Package: covidexplorer
Title: Explore COVID-19 Cases and Vaccination During the Delta Period
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("Vrunda", "Patil", , "vpat0051@student.monash.edu", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Bundles a cleaned subset of the Our World in Data COVID-19
    dataset and a Shiny app that lets public health students compare new
    cases and vaccination coverage across countries during the Delta
    period. Also includes a function to summarise cases and vaccination
    by country and date range.
